[0.000009, "o", "\u001b[90m2025-10-04T13:57:06.115Z\u001b[39m \u001b[34mINFO \u001b[39m  Step 2: animal + (animal --> living) => living \r\n"]
[0.000026, "o", "\u001b[90m2025-10-04T13:57:06.115Z\u001b[39m \u001b[34mINFO \u001b[39m  Step 3: living + (living --> mortal) => mortal \r\n"]
[0.00003, "o", "\u001b[90m2025-10-04T13:57:06.115Z\u001b[39m \u001b[34mINFO \u001b[39m  \\nResult: Through multi-step reasoning, the system deduces that 'bird' is 'mortal'. \r\n"]
